      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1144873304612870
    m_Localized: "On July 30, 16 Russian soldiers escaped from the Nazi camp \u2018Ulmenstok\u2019,
      risking everything to break free.\n\nLed by Major Ryabchikov, their senior
      officer, they reached the thick forest \u2014 but the Nazis are now hunting
      them down.\n\nThe survival of these men depends on YOU, Comrade Ryabchikov!
      Guide them through danger, outsmart the enemy, and bring your soldiers back
      to the front!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1144873304612871
    m_Localized: 'The game has indicators that change based on your decisions:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1144873304612872
    m_Localized: Remember, every choice you make will decide the fate of your group.
      Good luck, Major
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1144873304612873
    m_Localized: The number of people in your group.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1144873304612874
    m_Localized: The amount of supplies. Every day, you will use at least one supply,
      no matter what.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1144873304612875
    m_Localized: Patrol level. If it reaches 8, the Nazis will catch and kill you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1144873304612876
    m_Localized: The number of days left to reach the front.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1144873304612877
    m_Localized: Start
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
